---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Loft Conversion Soham | Truleum Cambridgeshire Specialists"
  description="Expert loft conversion services in Soham, Cambridgeshire. Local team for dormer, Velux and bespoke loft builds across Soham and East Cambridgeshire villages."
>

  <main class="main-content area-soham-page" style="font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;">

    <style>
      .area-soham-page {
        --area-blue: #0a1a4a;
        --area-blue-2: #162b70;
        --area-gold: #c9902e;
        --area-soft: #f5f7fb;
        --area-text: #334155;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
      .area-wrap { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; }
      .area-soham-page section,
      .area-soham-page h1,
      .area-soham-page h2,
      .area-soham-page h3,
      .area-soham-page p,
      .area-soham-page img,
      .area-soham-page a { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; }
      .area-hero { padding: 112px 0 96px; color: #fff; background: radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, rgba(212,175,55,0.24) 0%, rgba(212,175,55,0) 45%), linear-gradient(132deg, #08163d 0%, #0a1a4a 45%, #1c347f 100%); }
      .area-hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.08fr 0.92fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
      .area-kicker { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,232,159,0.98); color: #0a1a4a; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 18px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .area-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 58px); line-height: 1.1; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 18px; max-width: 15ch; }
      .area-hero p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); margin: 0 0 26px; max-width: 60ch; }
      .area-hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 28px; }
      .area-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; padding: 14px 24px; }
      .area-btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe89f 0%, #9f7628 100%); color: #111827; }
      .area-btn-ghost { color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
      .lc-metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 8px; }
      .lc-metric { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; }
      .lc-metric strong { display: block; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1; color: #ffe89f; margin-bottom: 6px; }
      .lc-metric span { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.84); }
      .area-hero-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.11); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
      .area-hero-card img { width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; }
      .area-price { margin-top: 14px; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; color: #0a1a4a; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
      .area-price strong { color: #111827; font-size: 19px; }
      .area-section { padding: 86px 0; }
      .area-head { text-align: center; max-width: 830px; margin: 0 auto 34px; }
      .area-head h2 { color: var(--area-blue); font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px); line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 12px; }
      .area-head p { color: #475569; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; }
      .area-intro { background: var(--area-soft); }
      .area-columns { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 26px; }
      .area-panel { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e9f2; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); }
      .area-panel h3 { color: var(--area-blue); font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
      .area-panel p { color: var(--area-text); line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 14px; }
      .area-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 9px; }
      .area-list li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 9px; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; }
      .area-list i { color: var(--area-gold); margin-top: 3px; }
      .area-types-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
      .area-type { border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff; padding: 20px; }
      .area-type h3 { font-size: 21px; color: var(--area-blue); margin: 0 0 8px; }
      .area-type p { margin: 0; color: var(--area-text); line-height: 1.75; font-size: 15px; }
      .area-zone { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a1a4a 0%, #102559 100%); }
      .area-zone .area-head h2, .area-zone .area-head p { color: #fff; }
      .area-zone-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
      .area-zone-item { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; }
      .area-zone-item h3 { color: #ffe89f; font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
      .area-zone-item h3 a { color: #ffe89f; text-decoration: none; }
      .area-zone-item h3 a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      .area-zone-item p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
      .area-proof-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
      .area-proof { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 14px; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }
      .area-proof i { color: var(--area-gold); font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
      .area-proof h3 { color: var(--area-blue); font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 7px; }
      .area-proof p { margin: 0; color: #475569; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
      .area-faq { background: var(--area-soft); }
      .area-faq-grid { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
      .area-faq-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; }
      .area-faq-item h3 { color: var(--area-blue); margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 19px; }
      .area-faq-item p { margin: 0; color: #334155; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 15px; }
      .area-cta { padding: 88px 0; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1a4a 0%, #1f3a8a 100%); }
      .area-cta h2 { color: #fff; margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px); }
      .area-cta p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 24px; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 17px; }
      @media (max-width: 1080px) { .area-types-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .area-zone-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .area-proof-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
      @media (max-width: 900px) { .area-hero { padding: 86px 0 70px; } .area-hero-grid, .area-columns { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .area-hero h1 { max-width: 100%; } }
      @media (max-width: 680px) { .lc-metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .area-section, .area-cta { padding: 64px 0; } .area-types-grid, .area-zone-grid, .area-proof-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .area-head p, .area-hero p, .area-cta p { font-size: 16px; } }
    </style>

    <section class="area-hero">
      <div class="area-wrap area-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="area-kicker"><i class="fas fa-location-dot"></i> Soham, Cambridgeshire</span>
          <h1>Loft Conversion Soham Cambridgeshire Homes</h1>
          <p>Need a loft conversion in Soham? We serve Soham and the wider East Cambridgeshire area with loft conversion projects for village terraces, period semis and modern family homes. Every build is planned around your roof structure and specific requirements. See our full <a href="/services/loft-conversion-cambridge-service/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Loft Conversion Service page</a> for what we include.</p>
          <div class="area-hero-actions">
            <a href="/contact/" class="area-btn area-btn-primary">Get Free Survey <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            <a href="/gallery/" class="area-btn area-btn-ghost">View Our Work</a>
          </div>
          <div class="lc-metrics">
            <div class="lc-metric"><strong><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i></strong><span>Free Site Survey</span></div>
            <div class="lc-metric"><strong><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></strong><span>Fully Insured</span></div>
            <div class="lc-metric"><strong><i class="fas fa-award"></i></strong><span>Quality Assured</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="area-hero-card">
          <img src="/wp-content/uploads/Loft-Conversion/loft-conversion-cambridge.webp" alt="Loft conversion in Soham Cambridgeshire by Truleum">
          <div class="area-price">
            <span>Typical project budget</span>
            <strong>From £27,000</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-section area-intro">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <div class="area-head">
          <h2>Local Approach For Every Loft Conversion In Soham</h2>
          <p>We plan each Soham loft conversion around your roof structure, planning situation and how you need the room to work for your household. Our <a href="/loft-conversion-cambridge-guide-for-homeowners/" style="color: var(--area-blue); font-weight:600;">homeowner guide</a> explains the full process from initial survey through to completion.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-columns">
          <article class="area-panel">
            <h3>What You Get</h3>
            <p>Your Soham loft conversion includes structural build, insulation, roof windows or dormers, electrics and a quality finish throughout the new space.</p>
            <ul class="area-list">
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Written quote with clear stage by stage pricing</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Regular project updates from survey to handover</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Practical layouts for bedrooms, home offices or ensuites</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Building regulations compliance managed throughout</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="area-panel">
            <h3>Why Soham Homes Need Specialist Input</h3>
            <p>Soham and the surrounding East Cambridgeshire villages have a mix of older period housing and newer family homes, each with different roof structures and planning requirements. See the <a href="https://www.planningportal.co.uk/permission/common-projects/loft-conversion" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">Planning Portal loft conversion guidance</a> for permitted development rules.</p>
            <ul class="area-list">
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Experience with village terraces, semis and modern homes</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Roof assessment to confirm suitability before any commitment</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Design to make the most of available headroom and floor area</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Advice on permitted development and local planning rules</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-section">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <div class="area-head">
          <h2>Popular Loft Conversion Types For Soham Properties</h2>
          <p>We recommend the best option for your property type and goals. Our <a href="/loft-conversion-glossary/" style="color: var(--area-blue); font-weight:600;">loft conversion glossary</a> explains each type in plain language.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-types-grid">
          <article class="area-type">
            <h3>Dormer Conversion</h3>
            <p>Popular for Soham semis and terraces wanting real bedroom space. Creates strong headroom and usable floor area for a new room with natural light.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="area-type">
            <h3>Velux Conversion</h3>
            <p>Uses roof windows to add light and space with minimal external change. Often the most straightforward and cost effective route for village properties.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="area-type">
            <h3>Hip To Gable</h3>
            <p>Suited to Soham end of terrace and semi detached homes where wider room proportions are the goal. Converts the hip end to a full gable wall.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-section area-zone">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <div class="area-head">
          <h2>Areas We Cover Around Soham</h2>
          <p>We serve Soham and surrounding East Cambridgeshire communities with quality loft conversions and clear project management throughout.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-zone-grid">
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3>Soham Town</h3><p>Village town terraces, semis and modern family homes across Soham and its residential streets.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3>Fordham and Isleham</h3><p>East Cambridgeshire villages with traditional housing stock northeast of Soham.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3>Burwell and Wicken</h3><p>Growing village communities west of Soham with a mix of period and modern properties.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3>Newmarket Villages</h3><p>Communities on the East Cambridgeshire border including Exning, Kennett and Chippenham.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3><a href="/loft-conversion-ely/">Ely</a></h3><p>Cathedral city to the north serving as a hub for East Cambridgeshire loft projects.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3><a href="/loft-conversion-cambridge/">Cambridge</a></h3><p>Full city and surrounding village coverage southwest of Soham.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3><a href="/loft-conversion-huntingdon/">Huntingdon</a> Area</h3><p>Covering Huntingdon and surrounding Cambridgeshire communities within our service region.</p></article>
          <article class="area-zone-item"><h3><a href="/loft-conversion-march-cambridgeshire/">March</a> and Fenland</h3><p>Serving Fenland district communities north of Soham across the county.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-section">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <div class="area-head">
          <h2>Why Soham Homeowners Choose Truleum</h2>
          <p>Homeowners across Soham and East Cambridgeshire choose us for quality results, transparent pricing and reliable project delivery every time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-proof-grid">
          <article class="area-proof"><i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt"></i><h3>Local Team</h3><p>Good knowledge of East Cambridgeshire village properties, planning rules and site access.</p></article>
          <article class="area-proof"><i class="fas fa-file-signature"></i><h3>Transparent Quotes</h3><p>Written quotes with clear inclusions so you know exactly what is covered before work starts.</p></article>
          <article class="area-proof"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i><h3>Fully Insured</h3><p>Complete professional liability cover throughout every stage of your loft conversion project.</p></article>
          <article class="area-proof"><i class="fas fa-award"></i><h3>Quality Finish</h3><p>Attention to detail at every stage means a finished space you are genuinely pleased with.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-section area-faq">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <div class="area-head">
          <h2>Soham Loft Conversion FAQs</h2>
          <p>Common questions from Soham and East Cambridgeshire homeowners. See our <a href="/loft-conversion-cost-cambridge/" style="color: var(--area-blue); font-weight:600;">cost guide</a> for full pricing information.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-faq-grid">
          <article class="area-faq-item">
            <h3>How much does a loft conversion in Soham cost?</h3>
            <p>Most projects in Soham range from £27,000 to £60,000 depending on conversion type, structural requirements and finishing level. We give a clear written quote after a free site survey with no obligation.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="area-faq-item">
            <h3>Are village homes in Soham suitable for loft conversions?</h3>
            <p>Yes. Most traditional terraces, semis and modern family homes in Soham have roof spaces that convert well. We confirm suitability during the free survey before any commitment is made.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="area-faq-item">
            <h3>Do I need planning permission for a loft conversion in Soham?</h3>
            <p>Most conversions in Soham are covered by permitted development and do not need planning permission. Village conservation areas or properties with significant roof changes may need an application. We advise on this clearly from the start.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="area-faq-item">
            <h3>How long does a loft conversion in Soham take?</h3>
            <p>A typical build takes between 6 and 10 weeks from start, depending on the conversion type and level of finish required.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="area-cta">
      <div class="area-wrap">
        <p style="margin:0 0 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);">Useful links: <a href="/loft-conversion-glossary/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Loft Conversion Glossary</a> | <a href="/loft-conversion-cost-cambridge/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Cost Guide</a> | <a href="/loft-conversion-cambridge-guide-for-homeowners/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Homeowner Guide</a> | <a href="/loft-conversion-cambridge/" style="color:#ffe89f; font-weight:600;">Cambridge Area Page</a></p>
        <h2>Plan Your Soham Loft Conversion Today</h2>
        <p>Book a free consultation to discuss your project, understand the options and get a clear cost. We make the whole process easy to follow from start to finish.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="area-btn area-btn-primary">Book Free Consultation <i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much does a loft conversion in Soham cost?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Most projects in Soham range from £27,000 to £60,000 depending on conversion type, structural requirements and finishing level."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Are village homes in Soham suitable for loft conversions?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Most terraces, semis and modern family homes in Soham have roof spaces that convert well. We confirm suitability during the free survey."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do I need planning permission for a loft conversion in Soham?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Most conversions in Soham are permitted development. Village conservation areas or significant roof changes may need a planning application."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does a loft conversion in Soham take?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A typical Soham loft conversion takes 6 to 10 weeks from build start, depending on type and finish level."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
    </script>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
